OL,3,GNEWSACrime gang's 30 skips of waste    
OL,4,Acleared from street                    
OL,6,FThe "significant accumulation" of waste
OL,7,F"caused concern for ward councillors,  
OL,8,Flocal residents and surrounding        
OL,9,Fbusinesses, and attracted considerable 
OL,10,Flocal attention", it said.             
